change:
  id: CHG-023
  title: Keep fitness magnitude and decision inseparable
  status: delivered
  intent: Prevent semantics-free ranking and preserve raw near-miss resolution by carrying a candidate's magnitude and decision in one ordered value.
  audience_level: developer
  relates_to:
    - CON-002
    - RISK-007
    - PAT-004

deltas:
  - op: MODIFIED
    capability: mutation-fitness-loop
    requirement: Fitness is one ordered domain value whose decision outranks magnitude, and whose magnitude remains raw until presentation.
    scenarios:
      - id: S1
        when: a discarded candidate has a raw magnitude of 0.95 and a promoted candidate has 0.85
        then: comparison ranks the promoted candidate higher
        and:
          - consumers receive FitnessScore rather than an independently sortable primitive score
      - id: S2
        when: two discarded candidates have raw magnitudes 0.5949 and 0.5851
        then: the archive ranks 0.5949 higher without a rounded tie
      - id: S3
        when: a raw magnitude of 0.5949 is persisted and reported
        then: storage preserves 0.5949 and the console displays 0.59
      - id: S4
        when: an otherwise eligible candidate scores 0.797
        then: it is discarded because the unchanged promotion threshold compares the raw magnitude

acceptance:
  - scenario: S1
    test_id: domain/FitnessScoreTest.ordersPromotionAboveADiscardEvenWhenTheDiscardHasTheLargerMagnitude
    layer: unit
  - scenario: S1
    test_id: deterministic/LineageNoveltyMemoryPolicyTest.aHigherScoringFailureDoesNotTakeAChampionSlotFromAPromotion
    layer: unit
  - scenario: S2
    test_id: deterministic/LineageNoveltyMemoryPolicyTest.magnitudeStillOrdersRecordsWithinOneDecision
    layer: unit
  - scenario: S2
    test_id: adapters/SqliteEvolutionaryMemoryStoreIntegrationTest.roundTripsObservableMemoryInTheExperimentLedger
    layer: integration
  - scenario: S3
    test_id: cli/ConsoleReporterTest.roundsRawMagnitudeOnlyWhenRenderingTheConsoleReport
    layer: unit
  - scenario: S4
    test_id: deterministic/PhenotypeFitnessScorerPropertyTest.decisionIsDerivedFromRawSumNotRoundedAggregate
    layer: unit

tasks:
  - id: T1
    slice: introduce FitnessScore and replace separate result and memory fields
    status: completed
  - id: T2
    slice: retain raw scorer magnitude and round only at the console boundary
    status: completed
  - id: T3
    slice: replace SQLite and envelope aggregate names without compatibility paths
    status: completed
  - id: T4
    slice: prove decision-first and raw-precision behaviour with unit and integration tests
    status: completed

non_goals:
  - migration of local experiment ledgers
  - compatibility aliases for aggregate score fields
  - a changed promotion threshold or gate policy

risks:
  - SQLite REAL storage is appropriate for the current [0,1] objective range, while FitnessScore keeps the domain comparison out of primitive double APIs.
